list.item:
“2. And whereas such attempt has been accompanied by threats of violence
                        and bloodshed and a display of armed force, and such attempt and acts and
                        threats are revolutionary and treasonable in character;

div.p:
“Now, therefore, we, the citizens of Honolulu of all nationalities and regardless
                    of political party affiliations, do hereby condemn and denounce the action of
                    the Queen and her supporters;
